/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!function_infos(F)` construct.
 *
 * The pragma describes a function as a whole in a core::types::info::FunctionInfo:
 * its name, its kind and its attributes, what `__pragma!parameter_infos`
 * describes per parameter.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::function_infos
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/function_infos.yr
 * @Author(s):
